      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "JUSTIFY ONLY WITH EVIDENCE\nOption 1: required summary grain, limited relationships or Excel tests fail after tuning.\nOption 2: required grain cannot fit Import/refresh budget or critical queries cannot hit aggregates.\nBoth must fail agreed SLAs; rule out Snowflake/network/copy bottlenecks before buying capacity.",
      "originalText": "JUSTIFY ONLY WITH EVIDENCE\nOption 1: required summary grain, limited relationships or Excel tests fail after tuning.\nOption 2: required grain cannot fit Import/refresh budget or critical queries cannot hit aggregates.\nBoth must fail agreed SLAs; rule out Snowflake/network/copy bottlenecks before buying capacity.",
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "e203",
      "lineHeight": 1.3,
      "autoResize": false
    },
    {
      "id": "e205",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 675,
      "width": 1740,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#000000",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "e181",
      "seed": 205,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 205,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "FIRST TEST: only after Options 1 and 2 fail, propose a separate synthetic sandbox benchmark and seek approval. No resource changes were made.",
      "originalText": "FIRST TEST: only after Options 1 and 2 fail, propose a separate synthetic sandbox benchmark and seek approval. No resource changes were made.",
